From 0eec04e7d7aa3653765266fbfaaf69c5673e9cc3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 01:58:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Fence stale quota assertions and persist portable
 cheap-check recovery

Recover interrupted worker-3 work: portable assertion cohort identity, episode-scoped errors, configuration aliases and historical alias event reads. Fence pre-clear GitHub runs, including workers admitted during the check. Keep durable success when older assertions age out. Proof: 93 focused tests; two independent-review regression tests RED before fixes, 1371 focused and subprocess scanner tests GREEN after fixes.
